[engl]
{100}{}{none}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Has weapon}
{1020}{}{Repeat meeting.}
{1030}{}{First meeting.}
{2000}{}{This isn't the time or place for weapons, friend. But if you care to try me sometime in the ring, feel free.}
{2010}{}{Goodbye.}
{3000}{}{You again. What now?}
{3010}{}{I'm here to teach you some manners.}
{3020}{}{Can you tell me about Junktown?}
{3030}{}{I need to talk to you about Trish.}
{3040}{}{Goodbye.}
{4000}{}{What do you want?}
{4010}{}{What do you do here?}
{4020}{}{A tough guy, eh? I bet I could take you.}
{5000}{}{Well, you're in the right place if you're looking for someone to pound that ugly mug of yours into a better shape.}
{5010}{}{What can you tell me about Junktown?}
{5020}{}{Uh, no thanks. Can I ask you some questions?}
{5030}{}{So, you been living in Junktown long?}
{5040}{}{Well, nice to meet ya. Later.}
{5050}{}{That'll be tough with no head, palooka.}
{6000}{}{If you are just looking for supplies, you should try Killian Darkwater's store, off southeast of here...}
{6010}{}{So, tell me more about the casino.}
{6020}{}{Who're the Skulz?}
{6030}{}{Goodbye.}
{7000}{}{Well, be sure to keep your hands off, eh? ... She's very important to me. ... [Saul frowns.] But she doesn't like my boxing...}
{7010}{}{So what is there to do in this town?}
{7020}{}{Uh, can we change the subject?}
{7030}{}{She's concerned for your welfare...}
{7040}{}{I think she's worried about you.}
{8000}{}{[Saul laughs heartily.] Why, I am a boxer!}
{8010}{}{Ah, I could kick your ass.}
{8020}{}{Hmm. What's the deal?}
{8030}{}{Oh. Well, good luck.}
{9000}{}{Hmm. Well, stranger, I work for Gizmo. He's the owner of that great casino there...}
{9010}{}{How did you become a boxer?}
{9020}{}{What is there to do here?}
{9030}{}{Can you tell me a bit about Gizmo and that casino?}
{9040}{}{Goodbye.}
{10000}{}{Yes. --- I've been here all my life. Grew up here.}
{10010}{}{Well, nice to meet ya. Later.}
{10020}{}{What can you tell me about Junktown?}
{10030}{}{How did you become a boxer?}
{11000}{}{Gizmo's casino is where everybody goes to gamble. There are many games and you can have a great time!...}
{11010}{}{What else is there to do around here?}
{11020}{}{Goodbye.}
{12000}{}{The Skulz are a bad bunch who hang out in the back of the Crash House...}
{12010}{}{Goodbye.}
{12020}{}{Thanks for the tip. I'll watch my step.}
{12030}{}{I see. Anything else you can tell me about?}
{13000}{}{What can I help you with?}
{13010}{}{Thanks for chatting. See you around.}
{13020}{}{What is there to do here?}
{13030}{}{Can you tell me a little about your boss?}
{13040}{}{[You pat your weapon] I'd like you to meet my little friend.}
{14000}{}{I never thought of it that way. I figured that she just didn't like boxing. I suppose I will have to talk to her more about this. Thanks.}
{14010}{}{See you around.}
{15000}{}{Ah, she just doesn't like boxing, is all.}
{15010}{}{See you around}
{15020}{}{Well, can we talk about something else?}
{15030}{}{I think she's worried about you.}
{16000}{}{Been boxing for a few years. --- I was always getting into scuffles with my brothers when I grew up...}
{16010}{}{Goodbye.}
{16020}{}{So what is there to do in this town?}
{16030}{}{Can you tell me about your boss?}
{16040}{}{What happened to your brothers?}
{17000}{}{My brother James was killed in a raider attack a few years ago. Shortly after that, my other brother, Darrell... set off south towards a mythical place called the Glow...}
{17010}{}{Goodbye.}
{17020}{}{Why do you stay in Junktown?}
{17030}{}{Uh, can we change the subject?}
{17040}{}{I'm sorry to hear of your loss.}
{17050}{}{What do you know about this legendary place, the Glow?}
{18000}{}{I live here. I like boxing, I have a good life with Trish, and I have no desire to go elsewhere.}
{18010}{}{Goodbye.}
{18020}{}{Oh. Well, that's good. Mind if we change the subject?}
{18030}{}{Yes, I've met Trish.}
{19000}{}{Thank you. It's been a few years, but I still don't like to talk about it much.}
{19010}{}{So, can I ask you some questions?}
{19020}{}{Goodbye.}
{20000}{}{From what I've heard, the Glow is a great crater that glows at night...}
{20010}{}{Interesting. Can you give me any more info?}
{20020}{}{I see. Thanks for the info.}

